### VS Code "REST Client" 확장으로 API를 바로 테스트할 수 있습니다 (Send Request 클릭)
@api = http://localhost:3001/api

### 서버 상태
GET {{api}}/healthz

### 병원 검색
GET {{api}}/clinics?department=Internal

### 보험 본인부담 계산
POST {{api}}/insurance/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "insuranceType": "nhis_employed", "visitType": "clinic", "totalCost": 50000 }

### 의료 번역 (OpenAI 키 필요)
POST {{api}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "I have had a fever and sore throat for three days.", "targetLanguage": "Korean" }

### 챗봇
POST {{api}}/chatbot
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "I have a headache and dizziness since this morning", "language": "English" }
